\chapter{Design}
The frame is a welded truss of S355 steel.
\section{Load Cases}
Dead load, live load, and wind are combined per the design code.

\chapter{Procedure}
\section{Overview}
Specimens are prepared, instrumented, and tested in sequence.
\subsection{Data Collection}
Strain gauges are sampled at 1 kHz for each load step.
\subsection{Calibration}
\label{sec:calib}
Load cells are calibrated with reference weights before each session; before each session.
\section{Reporting}
Results are archived with their calibration records; see Section~\ref{sec:calib}.

